            "review_title": "Review at APNA Indian Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Gaurav G\n13 contributions\n0\nWorst restaurant with pathetic food and overcharging scam\nAug 2026 • Solo\nThis restaurant do scam with people. For a bill of 172000VND and making it around 179000VND with the addition of 4 percent surcharge for using credit card, when I tried to pay with card he started charging me 256000VND and asked me to just tap the card on the top of machine and keeping the display on his side so that I cannot see the displayed amount on screen. When I said card is not tappable then he hesitated that now he is going to be caught and when I saw the screen and asked that why you are charging me this then he was clueless as he was caught red handed. He was planning to charge me almost 78000VND extra by making me tap the card on POS machine without showing me the displayed amount.\nOne more thing which is rare in Vietnam but this restaurant do is that if you have ordered any soft drink like Coca Cola then they will put 10 percent tax separately on this drink and put 8 percent tax separately on food which is not done by others.\nThe general practice is to put a flat 8 percent tax on the total food bill.\nFood is not up to the mark and lack authentic Indian taste rather it is just okay even after paying a decent amount for this food.\nWould not recommend this restaurant to anyone looking for good Indian food in old quarter area as there are so many other better options available in the vicinity at the same or lesser price point. \nWhen I wrote this very personal experience of mine on google review for this restaurant then they they try to defend themselves by saying that it is a fake review. Why would I need to write a fake review and if it is fake then why don’t you explain to everyone that why you tried to overcharge me. They called it Asa fake review on google because they know on google reviews if someone write a review for any outlet then they can write whatever they feel like below it in defense in order to hide their wrong doings but after this the person who has written the review do not get any chance of replying to the false narrative and defense presented by the outlet as google do not allow it\nRead more\nWritten August 26, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
