            "review_title": "Review at APNA Indian Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Monisha Dalia\n5 contributions\n0\nCute joint , amazing food, takeaway & grab also possible\nMay 2026 • Family\nThe food is freshly made with amazing taste. Cute small food joint. First day we happened to discover the restaurant on our way to the market , next day while returning from beer street, where the food is pretty ok , while going back to our suite , which was late at night, i got very hungry and no food joint was open on the way, midnight it was , we bumped into the apna indian guys, their restaurant was already closed , but on request they immediately made us sit inside comfortably and prepared fresh food for us … so very thankful for the amazing tasting food\nRead more\nWritten June 1, 2026",
